# frame_overrun.scn: a frame loop whose frames outlast the tick, for the harness's missed-tick report, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Frame mode with only the tick line enabled; each of 8 frames idles once, reads the buttons 500 times, more work than one tick period, and presents.
enable 0x0100
tick 1
repeat 8
idle 1
repeat 500
log_buttons
end_repeat
present
end_repeat
